{% comment %}
  Trusted Shops trustbadge (floating-trust-and-scroll-top spec): right edge, stacked
  above ob-scroll-top (bottom-left covered the page-width content's left edge). On mobile
  it is hidden until a reveal point further down the page (ob-scroll-top.js). Theme-snippet
  integration for the dev shop only — the official Trusted Shops Shopify app replaces
  this at live migration (see MIGRATION-TO-LIVE.md).

  Offsets: the widget's own bottom is 54px on desktop and 10px on mobile (its mobile
  layout applies up to 648px). Each offset puts the badge 15px above the arrow's top edge.

  The widget appends div#trustbadge-container-<hash> to <body> with an inline
  z-index of 2147483647; component-ob-scroll-top.css pulls that below the fixed bars and
  drawers. The mobile y-offset is chosen here because the widget's inner fixed element
  only has hashed class names: on templates with a fixed bottom bar (PDP purchase bar,
  cart CTA dock) the arrow is lifted above it, and the badge with it.
  Mobile fadeout stays off: the widget's fadeout hides the badge once the page scrolls
  and only shows it again at the very top, the opposite of what the stack needs.
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign ob_ts_id = 'XEF6A9A6375D0B95B950D0A48C758ABA3'
  assign ob_ts_mobile_offset = 64
  if template.name == 'product' or template.name == 'cart'
    assign ob_ts_mobile_offset = 142
  endif
-%}
{%- unless request.design_mode -%}
  <script
    async
    charset="UTF-8"
    data-desktop-y-offset="20"
    data-mobile-y-offset="{{ ob_ts_mobile_offset }}"
    data-desktop-disable-reviews="false"
    data-desktop-enable-custom="false"
    data-desktop-position="right"
    data-desktop-custom-width="156"
    data-desktop-enable-fadeout="false"
    data-disable-mobile="false"
    data-disable-trustbadge="false"
    data-mobile-custom-width="156"
    data-mobile-disable-reviews="false"
    data-mobile-enable-custom="false"
    data-mobile-position="right"
    data-mobile-enable-topbar="false"
    data-mobile-enable-fadeout="false"
    data-color-scheme="light"
    src="https://widgets.trustedshops.com/js/{{ ob_ts_id }}.js"
  ></script>
{%- endunless -%}
